st865054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">hmmmn on the Scene From Maleficent where she takes her Throne, any ideas if thats what Samhain would be like?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm afraid I haven't seen that movie. But from the clips, it looks like there are definitely elements you could borrow for a <i>Changeling </i>game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T08:21:12-07:00","id":873097,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><b><i>The Devil Is a Part-Timer</i></b><br /> I know it\u2019s about demons, but I it\u2019s not hard to imagine a young member of House Ailil \u201cbattling\u201d his way up the ranks of a restaurant as his day job.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Little Monsters</b></i><br /> I have no idea how well the metaphysics of this film\u2019s world mesh with the game mechanics, but it *feels* very CtD.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Harry Potter</b></i><br /> Hear me out; Stories about <s>wizards</s> fae that are born with special powers, that are separate from the <s>muggles</s> unenchanted, and have to go to dimensionally segregated side-realms to be who they really are.<br /> </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-n